}\if{html}{\out{</div>}}

Measured on 1500 simulated trials with a true shape of 3, \code{init = 0} left the
shape stuck at 0.69 and \code{ndt} at 0.999, with \code{Rhat} 2.3 and an effective
sample size of 3 after 306 seconds; an informative prior on the shape did
\emph{not} rescue it, because a prior cannot move a chain whose gradient is zero.
The \code{brms} default \code{init = "random"} also works, at 14 seconds. See
\code{\link[=cogmod_inits]{cogmod_inits()}} for the full account.
